From: RPi5 Camera Firmware Maintainers <maintainers@example.invalid>
Subject: [PATCH] netfilter: nft_dynset: mark serialized expression lists

nft_dynset_init requires NFT_DYNSET_F_EXPR for NFTA_DYNSET_EXPRESSIONS.
Set that flag exactly when dumping a list, retaining the inversion flag.
Without it, replay rejects standalone lists and the declared-set overrides
now exposed by the preceding ownership fix. Single and borrowed default
expressions retain their existing wire format.

Upstream-Status: Pending
Signed-off-by: RPi5 Camera Firmware Maintainers <maintainers@example.invalid>

--- a/net/netfilter/nft_dynset.c
+++ b/net/netfilter/nft_dynset.c
@@ -405,6 +405,7 @@
 		} else if (priv->num_exprs > 1) {
 			struct nlattr *nest;
 
+			flags |= NFT_DYNSET_F_EXPR;
 			nest = nla_nest_start_noflag(skb, NFTA_DYNSET_EXPRESSIONS);
 			if (!nest)
 				goto nla_put_failure;
